                My current work includes charge characterization and measurements of SQUATs (including in radioactive backgrounds), as well as Fabrication efforts of SQUATs at LBNL.
                My hope is to continue in a PhD program studying device qubits in Fall 2028. 
                Outside of the lab, I spent my time coaching volleyball and going on scuba diving adventures across the world! 
