                Outside of the lab, I love listening to tastefully-volumed Aphex Twin records on my sound system, solving 3x3 Rubiks cubes, thought-free dancing, and going to The Roxie in San Francisco while pestering my friends to more fervidly appreciate the color rendering achieved by their carbon-arc projectors and 35mm prints.
